  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you're within 5 feet of a creature on your turn, you can expend one Superiority Die and switch places with it, provided you spend at least 5 feet of movement and it is willing and not Incapacitated. This movement doesn't provoke Opportunity Attacks. Roll the die: until the start of your next turn, you or the other creature (your choice) gains a bonus to AC equal to the number rolled.</p>",
